{
  "comment": "Note type (model) definitions captured from the live collection via the anki MCP tools (model_field_names / model_templates / model_styling) on 2026-11-02. Used by create_model to recreate types when restoring cards into an empty collection. If a deck gains a new model, re-capture it the same way and add it here.",
